# Correctness of the selected radical evaluation matrix

For every original exterior generator, the published coefficient column is
exactly its selected entries in Eᵀ R. The block certificates check the first
fourteen displacement rows against the original full matrices, whose decoding
is established by ExteriorInvariance.basis_decode. They then compare every
selected bit to CompletenessData. No kernel or completeness premise is used.
See RadicalCertificate/source/README.md for the contract and
EvaluationCertificate/source/generate.py for reproducible witness generation.
-/

